Package: softgred
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ebtables, iptables, python3 (>= 3.9)
Recommends: logrotate
Suggests: iproute2, bridge-utils
Description: dynamic GRE Ethernet provisioning with a status dashboard
 Discovers remote IPv4 GRE Ethernet peers and provisions Linux gretap and
 VLAN interfaces on demand. Connects each VLAN to its configured bridge
 and maintains isolated firewall permissions for learned source MACs.
 .
 Includes a read-only TCP status API and an Python dashboard
 showing tunnels, clients, interfaces, bridge membership and packet
 counters. A PHP adapter is also provided for the same static frontend.
 .
 Records peer addresses, interface creation, bridge attachment and MAC
 learning in /var/log/softgred.log. Includes systemd units, logrotate
 configuration and an English guide with a complete test-lab example.
 .
 Requires Linux GRE, VLAN and bridge support and root network privileges.
 Accepts unkeyed IPv4 GRE carrying Ethernet with one mapped inner VLAN.
 Intended for trusted ingress and management networks.
